        {
          "name": "Lay on Hands",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 3,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "champion",
            "focus",
            "healing",
            "manipulate",
            "vitality"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 willing living creature or 1 undead creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Your hands become infused with vitality energy, healing a living creature or damaging an undead creature with a touch.</p>\n<p>If you use lay on hands on a willing living target, you restore 6 Hit Points; if the target is one of your allies, they also gain a +2 status bonus to AC for 1 round.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Against an undead target, you deal 1d6 damage and it must attempt a basic Fortitude save; if it fails, it also takes a -2 status penalty to AC for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 6, and the damage to an undead target increases by 1d6.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "aQYLveJhm47EhXdn"
        },
        {
          "name": "Litany against Wrath",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 3,
          "heightenedLevel": 3,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "champion",
            "concentrate",
            "focus",
            "good",
            "holy",
            "litany"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1",
          "duration": "1 round",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 evil creature",
          "save": "will",
          "description": "<p>Your litany rails against the sin of wrath, punishing the target for attacking good creatures. The target must attempt a Will save. A particularly wrathful creature, such as a wrath demon, uses the outcome one degree of success worse than the result of its saving throw. The target then becomes temporarily immune to all of your litanies for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The first time the target uses an action that deals damage to at least one good creature, the target takes 3d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Each time the target uses an action that deals damage to at least one good creature, the target takes 3d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Enfeebled 2. Each time it uses an action that deals damage to at least one good creature, the target takes 3d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
          "cast": false,
